The MCP tool definitions and stdio server setup in bootterm_mcp.py are adapted
from xtell-cn/xtell-serial, xtell_serial_mcp.py (blob
dc57638ac3439374166deceb3225639d98fc30ca), licensed under Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/xtell-cn/xtell-serial/blob/main/xtell_serial_mcp.py

Changes: replaced the GUI/TCP hub with local BootTerm subprocesses; added
bounded histories, validation, lifecycle management and a shared terminal
console over a local Unix socket. No xtell GUI code is included.

